  "referenceNumber": "RUS0054",
  "remarks": "\nMember of the State Duma, elected from the illegally annexed Autonomous Republic of Crimea. Former Prosecutor of the so-called ‘Republic of Crimea’. Actively implemented Russia's annexation of Crimea. Currently First Deputy Chairperson of the Committee for International Affairs, member of the Commission on the investigation on foreign interference in the internal affairs of the Russian Federation, member of the Committee for Security and countering corruption of the State Duma of the Russian Federation. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
